      },
      "message": "docs(agents): issues work on their own branch from latest main, finish as a pushed PR, and a cut goes PR review -> merge -> tag\n\n- Issue Law: sync main, branch issue/N-<slug>, push + PR with Fixes #N\n  instead of committing to main; `in-review` label once the PR is open\n  (the pick query skips it); changelog rows written at the cut from each\n  PR's Changelog: line.\n- Commits and Releases: a cut reviews and merges the issue PRs (merge\n  commits), runs the release gate on release/vX.Y.Z, opens a release PR,\n  then tags main's merge commit.\n- scripts/release.ps1 gains -NoTag for the release branch.\n- RECOMMENDED.md records the decisions filling in the mechanics.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
